WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.700
Two colleagues talk about their mornings.

2
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:06.110
O której wstajesz?

3
00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:08.720
Zwykle o siódmej. A ty?

4
00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:12.130
Ja wstaję o szóstej, bo zaczynam pracę o siódmej.

5
00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:18.920
To say at what time: a short word, then the hour as an ordinal number.

6
00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:21.010
Tak wcześnie!

7
00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:24.920
Wstaję o siódmej.

8
00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:29.800
The hour comes after a short word meaning at.

9
00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:36.830
Then the hour as an ordinal: the seventh, the eighth, the fifth.

10
00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:43.830
Ola asks what time Marek gets up. What does she say?

11
00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:48.390
O której wstajesz?

12
00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:52.750
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

13
00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:56.110
O której wstajesz?

14
00:00:58.110 --> 00:01:00.830
Say: I get up at seven.

15
00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:05.270
Wstaję o siódmej.

16
00:01:06.070 --> 00:01:09.630
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

17
00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:12.870
Wstaję o siódmej.

18
00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:17.670
Say: I go to work.

19
00:01:20.670 --> 00:01:21.870
Idę do pracy.

20
00:01:22.670 --> 00:01:26.230
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

21
00:01:28.030 --> 00:01:29.230
Idę do pracy.

22
00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:34.790
Now practise with the exercises below the video.
